    "created_at": "2019-03-19T20:58:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-19T20:58:06Z",
    "body": "I'm not thinking strictly about enforcing process isolation. More like I want to embed this content and it really doesn't have to interact with my content so let me limit the scope I expose to it. So I don't think it necessarily ties into the agent cluster key.\r\n\r\nie. having two documents directly scriptable probably isn't widely used and it should be easy to opt out of it.\r\n\r\n",
