    "created_at": "2019-03-20T09:13:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-20T09:13:25Z",
    "body": "Unless we also provide the ability for UAs to optionally process-isolate them it's not entirely clear to me it's worth it. Otherwise they can still (accidentally) share memory via `SharedArrayBuffer` and affect each other's execution flow.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
